    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d61">

                <pb facs="0328" n="153" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v10-12mSupp/pg153"/>

                <head>61. Airgram A–145 from Bogota, September 5<anchor n="1" xml:id="d61-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Bogota</placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            type="conversation-or-meeting-date" when="1962-09-05">September 5,
                            1962</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <pb facs="d61-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d61-1"/>
                <p>SUBJECT: Transmitting Memorandum of Conversation.</p>
                <p>There is transmitted herewith a memorandum covering a conversation concerning the
                    violence problem in Colombia which I had with President Guillermo Leon Valencia on September 4,
                    1962.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed corresp="#p_FF_1">Fulton
                        Freeman</signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d61-a1.xml" xpointer="d61-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d61-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d61-f1-content">
                <p>Transmits September 4 memorandum of conversation between Ambassador Freeman and President Valencia on the violence problem in Colombia.
                    Secret. 4 pp. DOS, CF, 721.00/9–562.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
